-- title:
--   The relative-counting schedule satisfies the root recurrence
-- statement:
--   For $m\in\mathbb N$ and nonnegative real $c,\eta,\xi$, write $E_r=\operatorname{relativeCountingErrorSchedule}(m,c,\eta,\xi,r)$. Then every $r\in\mathbb N$ satisfies $(1+\xi)(3\eta+2\sqrt{3\eta}+2E_r+4\xi)\le(E_{r+1}-c)^2$.
